# THIS MACHINE'S SETTINGS for the project's scripts. Copy this file to tools/local.env and fill it
# in; tools/local.env is not committed, because every machine has its own. tools\run.cmd and
# tools/publish.sh read it. One NAME="value" per line; keep the quotes (paths have spaces).
#
# The Godot 4.7 executable: the test scripts and `publish --codegen` run it.
GODOT="C:/path/to/Godot_v4.7.1-stable_win64.exe"
